From: thor2002ro <thor2002ro@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Local: media: cedrus: add H616/H618 JPEG and MJPEG encoding

Encode complete baseline JPEG frames from NV12 input on H616 and H618.
Expose JPEG and MJPEG formats with quality control on the encoder node.
Finish JPEG buffers in process context for DMA-BUF synchronization.

Signed-off-by: thor2002ro <thor2002ro@gmail.com>
---
